{"id":"wb-6-591","name":"陈埭丁氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈埭丁氏宗祠","text":"陈埭丁氏宗祠位于中国福建省晋江市陈埭镇岸兜村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n丁氏远祖为阿拉伯人，明初定居此地。丁氏宗祠始建于明永乐年间，嘉靖三十九年（1560年）毁于兵燹，万历二十八年（1600年）重建。1985年被辟为晋江县博物馆陈埭回族史馆。丁氏宗祠整体布局呈“回”字形，正厅位于中部，四周为门厅、后厅和两侧廊庑，占地1359平方米。正厅面阔三间，进深五间，抬梁穿斗混用式木构架。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E5%9F%AD%E4%B8%81%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":94249303,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94249303","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2474b0bc1d5dacb389618672.jpg","title":"Ancestral_shrine_of_Ding_Family.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ancestral_shrine_of_Ding_Family.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/Ancestral_shrine_of_Ding_Family.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Allervous","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Ancestral shrine of Ding Family, Zayton","width":320,"height":192}}